@Corsica: re your GJ chart: if you did plan to buy that box and then stopped out in the way price took that stop, would you please kindly provide your own opinion(s) as to why it failed and what you would've done differently? if you did not plan to buy that box, then you don't need to reply to this:)

@Gero: re your AN chart: you did plan to sell box "SRK" that has "mpl" & "entry" in it, then obviously price proved otherwise. Would you please contribute your own opinion(s) as to why it failed & what you would've done differently?

@Alirezat: if you "have seen a few times this happen", would you also kindly contribute please? [Re: ITs taking the stops of fake RTM: i think this is not an issue as i don't see any logical proven track records from any of them yet. Let's put our mind on ours instead and just ignore them]

@Einrikr: re UCAD: I understand your reasons and I believe you have similar experiences in the past that also reflects my drawings (ref previous posts). your sharing here is greatly appreciated:)

@sev87: thanks for the chart, and would you please provide your opinion(s) as to how you have traded (or would've traded) that zone, and if failed, the reason(s).

Thank you all so far, I appreciate your posts and please do not hesitate to express your view(s), there are no absolute true or false opinion(s) here, I am simply asking for your favors, which i think would potentially be really beneficial for the readers too.
